  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Organisation of Circular Economy Seminar and Competition</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective (Impact) to which this action contributes is:The organisation of a Circular Economy Seminar and a Circular Economy Competition in the Greater Accra Region in 2022 to enhance the visibility of the EU-Ghana relationship. The seminar and competition will in particular focus on the future perspectives and challenges of the EU  Ghana economic cooperation and highlight ongoing trends and interventions in the circular economy eco-space and their impact on the Ghanaian economy</narrative>
  </description>
